  <item>
    <title>浅谈善堂——潮汕的NGO</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f523fbf9578163d6d3dbab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f523fbf9578163d6d3dbab</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Apr 2025 13:41:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>关于本期</span></strong><br><span>潮汕善堂，是带有民间信仰色彩的民间慈善机构。虽然在潮汕人的生活中，好似有时还能听到如存心善堂、报德善堂等有名的善堂名字，但很多人已然不知道善堂的历史，变迁，其现如今的社会作用。本期节目邀请了对此较有研究的熹老师，对善堂文化做一个整体介绍，希望能让大家对善堂有一个大概的了解～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>驾驶员</span></strong><br><span>陈奕熹 Coco</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>保修员</span></strong><br><span>Coco/Vicky/PP/章鱼哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>车载音乐</span></strong><br><span> </span><em><span>善堂</span></em><span>——吴鹏先生</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>地图导航</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 何为善堂？🧐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 善堂的宋大峰祖师信仰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 善堂的社会功能🏡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> 善堂的创办/危机—废除淫祠/现代功能变迁</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 善堂的“信仰色彩”🔮</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a> 近代的善堂—为何对大峰祖师的崇拜会变成一种宗教信仰，甚至演变成慈善事业？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 泰国的报德善堂🇹🇭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">1:01:01</a> “生有二哥丰，死有大峰公“—二哥丰何许人也？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>地图目标</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm8-O6jCHC1ceAsUmQEpqBab0hEj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fogx-RmYU0OtBrD5HXlBq_-m_fEb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7BlZuc2IZkqEHj4IIRF5vp0qA-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺1922年八二风灾后存心善堂赈救灾民老照片</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>以下照片和信息均由無吭聲老师提供！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmS3JUvztSHywQd4aailpla7tkNO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEmtCl6L08LuGEk9GbQekkL9vJk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺潮阳和平报德古堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvMGR-oQbeVWtn6vf2c8Sx9y21dp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiByEFIrtpX70REJwWpEnMTkue1_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺和平报德古堂赠大吴修德善堂帽子，在行善救人等义举中使用</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg6nlETAmKEBY4t3u4v7etX1fyCT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/li_zQZQs32DXXRJPA4h9R8yhTZyH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMcXnFsFd8pwAs8Mk_YrIQEEPdh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺摄于汕头存心善堂，每年依旧以民俗形式纪念七二八风灾中烈士和容易被遗忘的弱势群体</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqFJMYHM0sM5P3EO5m5G1VW-Ptda.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyuqRbfTAmt7Q9HiaMalwQ96efZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺马来西亚麻坡修德善堂，于2025年3月1日回銮大吴祖堂</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>联系我们！</span></strong><br><span>感谢你的收听～欢迎在节目下方给我们留言！有任何感想、反馈、建议、合作，欢迎和我们沟通交流！如果你也想参与到我们的录制中，有故事和大家分享，欢迎你联系我们来BiBi Radio做客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系方式：</span><br><span>📮邮箱：cocodynamite@163.com</span><br><span>🔺公众号：跑路艺术小组</span></p>]]></description>
