  <item>
    <title>高搭楼台巧艳妆，三人围坐话潮腔｜阿板</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674311f011045e78e57f1edc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674311f011045e78e57f1edc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Nov 2024 11:56:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>关于本期</span></strong><br><span>本期节目邀请了阿板老师——一个画潮剧衣箱的潮剧爱好者和创作者，一起来聊聊潮剧和潮剧服饰的故事。近期阿板老师的潮剧衣箱画展正在潮博馆展出，欢迎感兴趣的朋友前去观展呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>驾驶员</span></strong><br><span>阿板 阿肥 Coco</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>保修员</span></strong><br><span>Coco &nbsp;&nbsp;栋 &nbsp;&nbsp;Vicky &nbsp;&nbsp;PP &nbsp;章鱼哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>车载音乐</span></strong><br><span> </span><em><span>狱中歌</span></em><span>——范泽华</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>地图导航</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> 快问快答——来唱一段潮剧！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 跟潮剧的渊源🧐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 潮剧衣箱大揭秘！💼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 潮剧服饰的发展现状——专戏专服</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 潮剧盔头是什么🎩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1712">28:32</a> 潮剧与其他剧种🎭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> 现在还会严格遵循服饰要求吗？潮剧如今的发展如何？——对“经典”和创新的讨论</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 如何看待潮剧现状？🫣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a> 潮剧小白如何入坑？🎫</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 广场戏和剧场戏🏛️</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3343">55:43</a> “西装暴徒”——关于“出圈”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3520">58:40</a> 阿板的创作🎨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4170">01:09:30</a> 最后一问：活五调经典剧目《狱中歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>地图目标</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmCWtTUPTOttBOgGZUQ7ahMgQOfV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺</span><strong><span>阿板老师的展览！欢迎大家去看～</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk46siO88I-eZE7uRwyMQdbLlNjn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🔺阿板老师画过的潮剧衣箱人物</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpfQ1SRW5UIgYeN3d_olUUGJ8qsR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibHtQN832RwtCMVV0xTA32SxYKR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1uV8uQAvp0O347Mz9L4Ax0KnwO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoLSf1sLdMrZJ4W2EJBePnTUTtBY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsTEKk4J5cxmwEUfmeitXTKKkRyx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>联系我们！</span></strong><br><span>感谢你的收听～欢迎在节目下方给我们留言！有任何感想、反馈、建议、合作，欢迎和我们沟通交流！如果你也想参与到我们的录制中，有故事和大家分享，欢迎你联系我们来BiBi Radio做客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系方式：</span><br><span>📮邮箱：cocodynamite@163.com</span><br><span>🔺公众号：跑路艺术小组</span></p>]]></description>
