  <item>
    <title>我在广东“流浪”，发现潮州小城有“字由字在”的艺术魅力｜策展人陈颖婷</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670e1b11db2cf827575aeeb2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670e1b11db2cf827575aeeb2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Oct 2024 07:34:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️关于本期</span><br><span>最近潮州美术馆新推出了一个展览：字由字在——书写中的潮州。我们邀请了策展人婷老师，来分享展览背后的故事；以及婷老师作为一个“外地人”，“广东人”，对潮汕这片土地有什么感受？如何建立与它的连接感？也欢迎大家去看展噢～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>驾驶员</span></strong><br><span>陈颖婷 Coco Vicky</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>保修员</span></strong><br><span>Coco &nbsp;&nbsp;栋 &nbsp;&nbsp;Vicky &nbsp;&nbsp;PP</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>车载音乐</span></strong><br><span> </span><em><span>Over the Hill </span></em><span>— Ginger Root</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>地图导航</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> 快问快答🤓</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 字由字在——书写中的潮州展览简介</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 为什么想做这个展览？🧐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 为什么叫“字由字在”？🔠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 展览三单元：</span><br><span>书史之外｜日常书写｜非常书写</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> 关于公共教育——艺术就在我们身边🎨</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 婷老师：当一个四处漂泊的广东人来到潮州美术馆</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3021">50:21</a> 策展这个工作有趣的地方在哪里🥰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3075">51:15</a> 潮州初印象🌆</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3192">53:12</a> 被其貌不扬的食物惊艳了！这里的神明信仰是会感染人的！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3599">59:59</a> 潮汕到底排外吗？🤔</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4246">1:10:46</a> 漂泊中连接感如何建立</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4550">1:15:50</a> 最后一问🤓！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>地图目标</span></strong><br><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6XxYU_boiIA3JYEtnjdtbA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6XxYU_boiIA3JYEtnjdtbA"><span>展讯 | 字由字在——书写中的潮州</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/--fjScfhTdjoCOF8y2dqhg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/--fjScfhTdjoCOF8y2dqhg"><span>展品 | 字由字在——“书史之外”</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EcvcNSBCBh8Z8AfeoSa7wg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EcvcNSBCBh8Z8AfeoSa7wg"><span>展品 | 字由字在——“日常书写”</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Hgei6xR8PrOjsOA4Zm9BhQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Hgei6xR8PrOjsOA4Zm9BhQ"><span>展品 | 字由字在——“非常书写”</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhmBG-41Kru7yUad-ADABoEOM7-8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺</span><strong><span>书史之外—— 字由\ 潮州历代“日常书写”文献资料、实物与图片</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5eSpT1nFVSKl6GHFnfzmccG1cW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺</span><strong><span>日常书写—— 字在\ 潮州“民间书写”场景还原</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrKMQrvDGuHOsZEocM1tgWqWxqMq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺</span><strong><span>非常书写—— 字问\ 艺术实践与探索</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-jyT13dmHWYaHOfOp-dk7cfCmy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fii2bN8h-WyO9Lz5KK33hWspPjiV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>联系我们！</span></strong><br><span>感谢你的收听～欢迎在节目下方给我们留言！有任何感想、反馈、建议、合作，欢迎和我们沟通交流！如果你也想参与到我们的录制中，有故事和大家分享，欢迎你联系我们来BiBi Radio做客！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系方式：</span></strong><br><span>📮邮箱cocodynamite@163.com</span><br><span>🔺公众号：跑路艺术小组</span></p>]]></description>
