  <item>
    <title>我与家乡的关系，父亲的葬礼和潮汕女性｜野草寮林子（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dd6843ee04007d88f96034</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dd6843ee04007d88f96034</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Sep 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>🚗驾驶员</span></strong><br><span>野草寮林子 &nbsp;Coco &nbsp;阿B</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗保修员</span></strong><br><span>Coco &nbsp;&nbsp;栋 &nbsp;&nbsp;Vicky &nbsp;&nbsp;PP</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>车载音乐</span></strong><span> </span><br><span> </span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=2606659609&amp;userid=1404771608" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=2606659609&amp;userid=1404771608"><em><span>过暹罗(Go to Siam)</span></em></a><span>——野草寮</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=2606657895&amp;userid=1404771608" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=2606657895&amp;userid=1404771608"><em><span>猛走(Rush off)</span></em></a><span>——野草寮</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=495810022&amp;userid=1404771608" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=495810022&amp;userid=1404771608"><em><span>潮汕姿娘</span></em></a><span>——野草寮</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=2606657894&amp;userid=1404771608" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=2606657894&amp;userid=1404771608"><em><span>孥仔在外(A Child Away from Home)</span></em></a><span>——野草寮</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>地图导航</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 歌曲里的刻画和故事是真实发生的吗？🧐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 如何保持对潮汕的观察？离开了故乡才能真正知道故乡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a> 潮汕人很习惯“出走”，如何做这个选择？🚶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 对于你来说，你的“家”是哪里？——家乡是个亘古命题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> 潮汕人始终还是割舍不下故乡 why？🏡</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;——独特又割裂的文化 浓厚的乡土气息</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 《猛走》片段欣赏🎵</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;——和父亲的故事以及潮汕葬礼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 《潮汕姿娘》片段欣赏——听到更多她们的声音</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗地图目标</span></strong><span> </span><br><span> </span><a href="http://163cn.tv/w8DcQiM" data-url="http://163cn.tv/w8DcQiM"><span>野草寮网易云音乐主页</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗联系我们！</span></strong><br><span>感谢你的收听～欢迎在节目下方给我们留言！有任何感想、反馈、建议、合作，欢迎和我们沟通交流！如果你也想参与到我们的录制中，有故事和大家分享，欢迎你联系我们来BiBi Radio做客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系方式：</span><br><span>📮邮箱cocodynamite@163.com</span><br><span>🔺公众号：跑路艺术小组</span></p>]]></description>
