    <title>我在潮汕画老爷，老爷用上上签say yes｜無吭聲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bab72bdb5e6d6bf9d6d635</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bab72bdb5e6d6bf9d6d635</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Aug 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>🚗驾驶员</span></strong><br><span>無吭聲——野生插画师</span><br><span>Coco &nbsp;&nbsp;阿栋</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>保修员</span></strong><br><span>Coco &nbsp;&nbsp;栋 &nbsp;&nbsp;Vicky &nbsp;&nbsp;PP</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗车载音乐</span></strong><br><span> </span><em><span>The Black Meat—</span></em><a href="https://music.163.com/artist?id=88181" data-url="https://music.163.com/artist?id=88181"><em><span>Bark Psychosis</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗地图导航</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">0:56</a> 快问快答🤓</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">2:06</a> 我们怎么认识的🤗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">6:06</a> 之前收到的都是负反馈？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 自学画画的过程🎨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 什么契机开始画老爷？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 感天大帝，安济圣王和七圣夫人👑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2219">36:59</a> 跑寺庙搜集故事📝how？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> 保留民俗及其故事为何珍贵🏮——我们的根在哪？如何保存？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> 手指头差点被剪断的工厂经历：</span><br><span>“我在互联网之前，已经看过外面的世界了。”🏭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3742">1:02:22</a> 辞职 与家人的关系👪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3862">1:04:22</a> 无老师真诚发问：这期会有人听吗？！——我们做播客的初衷：对人的好奇🧐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4127">1:08:47</a> 最后一问</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4266">1:11:06</a> 那些神奇的梦☁️🌃</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>🚗地图目标</span></strong><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e3065c10000000001006f88?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d42c9bf000000001600e583&amp;apptime=1723429821&amp;share_id=a33e323c8b234e6da5d85a45989f513d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e3065c10000000001006f88?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d42c9bf000000001600e583&amp;apptime=1723429821&amp;share_id=a33e323c8b234e6da5d85a45989f513d"><em><span>無吭聲老师小红书</span></em></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>无老师的画</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🔺安济圣王</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVFDRsyec1x1c6TMlshZodpuTTC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🔺感天大帝</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr3bIBIi4OYmxHqFJXCsrwIXpokp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔺七圣夫人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiXdZPEzWVV_qCI9DQzuT0_Sh1f0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🔺家神-床婆</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FimcqBY7Mgjbb3O-H-aB2YnXllgT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🔺家神-门神郁垒</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhrPUwQn2c00XifG70AKEwWdN6Wn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🔺三山国王</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWz5Bw7J5yvXWNz9GTzndTOUJal.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>无老师跑寺庙拍摄的一些照片</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtScQE20ymosG6wzK17lgdrhIU0w.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvHLb57F_hC5YZjl-AYkLCP8newE.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqhrL3SnI3UUuz8kadJj-X-X_w_c.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8fPdk1MOB2P2kVfhgBSegrPhsx.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3j8mDeV3t3ZrV42YvbKGlKqsRJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBmT9LzHK5EASiYMxSvBULFD1Gw.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoRnSNeGVPqcpGBMTj1lDyhCixl8.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>🚗</span><strong><span>联系我们！</span></strong><br><span>感谢你的收听～欢迎在节目下方给我们留言！</span><br><span>有任何感想、反馈、建议、合作，欢迎和我们沟通交流！</span><br><span>如果你也想参与到我们的录制中，有故事和大家分享，欢迎你联系我们来BiBi Radio做客！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系方式：</span></strong><br><span>📮邮箱cocodynamite@163.com</span><br><span>🔺公众号：跑路艺术小组</span></p>]]></description>
