  <item>
    <title>“想不明白”的潮汕后生人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628a4c0f83ddae2d9e72a947</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">628a4c0f83ddae2d9e72a947</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 May 2022 14:43:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（前方有潮汕话出没，请小心驾驶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期BiBi Radio！</span><br><span>是，几个潮汕年轻人的座谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于这座小城，关于展览，关于生活和节奏；不敢说是关于艺术——</span><br><span>倒确实是关于想不明白。</span><br><span>不是真的想不明白，只是由跑路艺术小组发起的一个位于潮州的短期展览。</span><br><span>但也是真的想不明白。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（没错，在绕口令）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗驾驶员！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Coco</span></strong><span>_想不明白观众</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>奇奇</span></strong><span>_想不明白展-LGBT装置创作者</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>B老师</span></strong><span>_想不明白策展</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>L老师</span></strong><span>_刷墙/小广告指导</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗导航：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 《想不明白》：办展初衷</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 潮州&amp;汕头，潮汕年轻人现状</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 《想不明白》：备展过程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a> 潮汕和本土年轻人的现状</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 展览中的网红打卡现象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 《想不明白》：展览趣事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗指条明路：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1-10</span></strong><br><span>为什么办展？“想不明白”🤔️</span><br><span>潮汕的年轻人都在干嘛？</span><br><span>汕头的年轻人去哪玩？</span><br><span>关于慢生活的一些七七八八🧩</span><br><span>办展也请来潮汕！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>11-20</span></strong><br><span>潮汕年轻人都往哪去？</span><br><span>有趣的场所，才让人不枯竭🤩</span><br><span>展子如何办起来？办法和困难。</span><br><span>展子投稿来自——？🥳</span><br><span>是社区艺术实验，还是展览？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>21-30</span></strong><br><span>一面墙，或者说，半面</span><br><span>观众视角，想得明白吗？</span><br><span>不会买票就不会珍惜👊</span><br><span>工作人员哪里来，观众哪里来</span><br><span>但凡多几个沙龙！😭</span><br><span>一起有趣，好难</span><br><span>好的艺术，坏的展</span><br><span>暑假，“想明白了”🙌</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>31-40</span></strong><br><span>艺术与打卡，是悖论吗？</span><br><span>不如设置打卡地🤝</span><br><span>展览的所求与所得</span><br><span>观展歧视链…</span><br><span>你，礼貌吗😵</span><br><span>互动人数：敢叫日月换新天</span><br><span>社恐人进大观园🤒</span><br><span>举办中的有趣事！</span><br><span>LGBT 🏳️‍🌈 来观展！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚗BGM：</span></strong><br><span>雷猴乐队《观老三买厝后特别有感》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fp4B9JHn6sv0psq2DKiTkU39FOxv.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fo_poMl3v9g62UKW85AAJ1NXEGKY.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fj-oZvipyOPBFEyuC5awIOAJdT8q.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FjmGqmOz8OeO3Jj6asw1E8xlf4TZ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FiIRiD6jwcBGRuyD1j3aUybWWiw_.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FnaIuNcp9KVHIpMPijh-_ms_tujk.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkLdFiNEGPnbBNwUGdu89HPnIl4w.m4a" length="29821883" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:37</itunes:duration>
